          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Careful observations lead logically to abandoning the closed route and hand-carrying the invitations; the sheltered final bundle gives a concrete ending.\"},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The calm wind, open route, and successful test of Pip’s breath support the simple hand-delivery solution and clear image of filled pots.\"},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A brisk wind prompts a well-prepared twine-guided pouch, and the pouch’s measured slide creates a consequential, concrete resolution.\"},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"It has a sound safety-first arc and sheltered ending, though repairing and rigging a pouch becomes unused once the group chooses to carry the papers.\"},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The group checks wind, paper, and route before choosing hand delivery; the invitations in labeled pots provide a tidy visual finish.\"},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Pip’s failed puff meaningfully changes the plan to the sheltered route, with a clear, child-friendly ending under the chimney shelter.\"},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The brisk wind leads to a tied pouch and guide line, and Pip’s restrained puffs successfully move the bundle to the pots.\"},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The closed gate redirects the delivery, while the covered basket and Pip’s short puffs make the safe arrival feel earned.\"},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":6,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The closed route and wobbly breath already justify shelter, but the later pouch-and-twine preparation is unused and weakens the otherwise clear resolution.\"},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"After Pip’s breath proves unreliable and the glasshouse is closed, the group sensibly carries the invitations to a sheltered final arrangement.\"}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":1,\"causal_path\":4,\"ending\":3,\"language\":3,\"overall\":3},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All ten stories share Ada, Pip, and Mara delivering rooftop invitations by checking wind, route, and paper safety. There are meaningful but limited operational branches: open/calm conditions yield hand delivery in s000057 and s000034; brisk wind yields a twine-guided pouch in s000047 and s000068; a closed route leads to chimney-shelter delivery in s000029, s000043, s000096, s000085, s000073, and s000005. Most use highly repeated wording and end either at labeled pots or in the chimney nook, so this sample shows minor-to-moderate variation rather than distinct narratives.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"story_ids\":[\"s000057\",\"s000034\"],\"summary\":\"Gentle wind, open glasshouse route, and steady dragon breath permit careful hand delivery to labeled pots.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000047\",\"s000068\"],\"summary\":\"Brisk wind on an open route leads the group to secure invitations in a pouch and send it along a twine guide line to the pots.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000029\",\"s000043\",\"s000073\",\"s000085\",\"s000005\"],\"summary\":\"Pip’s breath is unreliable, so the group rejects air transport and carries invitations in small batches to the sheltered chimney nook; some unused pouch preparation appears in s000073 and s000005.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000096\"],\"summary\":\"The glasshouse route is closed, so the group covers the invitations in a basket and uses Pip’s gentle nudges to reach the chimney nook.\"}]}",
